<p data-structure="CDiscource" id="p_10">B. Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of mandamus directing the respondents not to realize any electricity duty pursuant to the impugned notification (marked as Annexure No. 5) dated 13.9.2012 on demand charges and to realised duty only n consumption of electricity. 
