<blockquote id="blockquote_38">	<a href="/doc/144427531/" id="a_40">Section 3</a> of the Act is a charging section providing for levy of electricity duty. <a href="/doc/82161362/" id="a_41">Section 3 (1)</a> and <a href="/doc/96343566/" id="a_42">Section 3(2)</a> which are relevant for the present case, are quoted as below: 
</blockquote> 

 
<blockquote id="blockquote_39">&quot;3. Levy of electricity duty.-(1) Subject to the provisions hereinafter contained, there shall be levied for and paid to the State Government on the energy:
</blockquote> 

 
